== exonerations (append-only or off-path) ==
- bootm "%s %s %s" adds only header-cmdline + verifiedbootstate. header = `androidboot.dtbo_idx=0 otg_device=1 buildvariant=user` (no selinux/reboot_mode).
- defendkey `setenv bootargs ${bootargs} defendkey=%x,%x,` fires only for recovery/update/factory_reset/upgrade_step==3. our path: fastboot.
- imgread/unpackimg setenvs are `0x%x` addr/size bookkeeping (filesize/loadaddr family). no bootargs write.
- bootvx writes the same env string, not a competing one.

== kernel entry decoded (SMC-at-entry theory dead) ==
0x37e21284, arch==2 (ARM64 Linux): x0=entry, x1=0xf81, x2=[images+0x100] (FDT), then 0x37e19264 = eret EL2->EL1 drop (x0=0,x1,x2). no SMC, no secure-world handoff at entry. E7's gate is verify-time (0x37e24cf0/0x37e24f90 aml_sec_boot_check) only.
fdt path reachable via OS table 0x37eb5658 -> 0x37e21378 -> 0x37e2122c -> 0x37e5b800 -> 0x37e5c324 -> fdt_chosen. fixup target == handoff blob (same [images+0x100] field). dtb_mem_addr=0x1000000 (htab/arena agree); dump blob has 6404 free tail bytes (nospace dead).

